{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）愛女陳康堤與香港網球新星黃澤林（Coleman）半年情玩完。</p><p>黃澤林即光速撻着「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）惹來全城怒轟。</p><p>風波持續發酵，有網民發現除了康堤之外，Eason與太太徐濠縈亦已取消關注黃澤林的社交平台帳號，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:19.382844+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.185849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.185849+00:00","content_hash":"70b230b3326251d3114a6291fc69c1c93c4635bba0719a5fe516b0c86be2ceb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}